{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25560","headline":"春山三朅来 一 · 李涉","name":"春山三朅来 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钓鱼朅来春日暖，沿溪不厌舟行缓。\n野竹初栽碧玉长，澄潭欲下青丝短。\n昔人避世兼避讐，暮栖云外朝悠悠。\n我今无事亦如此，赤鲤忽到长竿头。\n泛泛随波凡几里，碧莎如烟沙似砥。\n瘦壁横空怪石危，山花鬬日禽争水。\n有时带月归扣舷，身闲自是渔家仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}